      "fact": "savedValue saves incoming receiver x0 in x19 and sends dynamic hasSavedValue to that receiver; the selected hasSavedValue implementation is outside this body review.",
      "fact_ja": "savedValueは入口receiver x0をx19へ保存し、そのreceiverへ動的にhasSavedValueを送る。hasSavedValueの実効実装はこの本文照合の範囲外。",
