      "program": "MACore.arm64",
      "definition": "0x0009bcfc",
      "anchors": [
        "0009bd10",
        "0009bd14",
        "0009bd24"
      ],
      "fact": "FMOV D immediate f0 establishes IEEE754 -1.0 in d0. CBZ tests all of w0, not bit0: zero returns -1.0; nonzero reaches the current-field load.",
      "fact_ja": "FMOV Dの即値f0はIEEE754の-1.0をd0へ設定する。CBZはbit0だけではなくw0全体を検査し、0なら-1.0を返し、非0なら現在fieldの読出しへ進む。",
      "runtime_verified": false,
      "product_capability": false
    },
    {
      "id": "H014-03",
      "program": "MACore.arm64",
      "definition": "0x0009bcfc",
      "anchors": [
        "0009bd18",
        "0009bd1c",
        "0009bd20"
      ],
      "fact": "The nonzero path uses LDRSW on runtime offset slot001ab4e0, then loads d0 from receiver x19 plus that offset. The selected ivar declaration is _savedValue, offset32/type d/8 B; runtime object layout remains unverified.",
      "fact_ja": "非0の枝はruntime offset slot001ab4e0をLDRSWで読み、receiver x19とそのoffsetからd0へロードする。対応する宣言は_savedValue、offset32/type d/8 B。実objectのlayoutは未検証。",
      "runtime_verified": false,
      "product_capability": false
    },
    {
