      "program": "MACore.arm64",
      "definition": "0x0009bcfc",
      "anchors": [
        "0009bcfc",
        "0009bd2c"
      ],
      "fact": "The complete 52 B savedValue body has no direct legacy-flag or savedLongValue read, field store, or long-to-double conversion; it returns double d0, matching method type d16@0:8. This does not exclude migration in an unexamined callee or other method.",
      "fact_ja": "52 BのsavedValue本文全体には旧flag・savedLongValueの直接読出し、field格納、longからdoubleへの変換がない。method type d16@0:8に対応するdouble d0を返す。未読calleeや別methodの移行処理は否定しない。",
      "runtime_verified": false,
      "product_capability": false
    },
    {
      "id": "H014-05",
      "program": "Logic.arm64",
      "definition": "0x018e18e4",
      "anchors": [
        "018e18e4",
        "018e18f0"
      ],
      "fact": "The first selector stub is decodeObjectForKey: (slot0254ba38), bound through objc_msgSend. The body and stub preserve incoming receiver x0 and key x2 before this send; incoming unarchiver x3 is not a declared argument of that selector.",
      "fact_ja": "最初のselector stubはdecodeObjectForKey:（slot0254ba38）で、objc_msgSendへbindする。本文とstubは送信前の入口receiver x0とkey x2を保持する。入口unarchiver x3はこのselectorの宣言引数ではない。",
      "runtime_verified": false,
      "product_capability": false
    },
    {
      "id": "H014-06",
      "program": "Logic.arm64",
      "definition": "0x018e18e4",
      "anchors": [
        "018e18e4",
        "018e191c"
      ],
      "fact": "The complete 60 B proxy body does not save, retain, release, branch on or otherwise explicitly use incoming unarchiver x3. Residual x3 at a call is not proof that the callee uses it.",
      "fact_ja": "60 Bのproxy本文全体は入口unarchiver x3を保存・retain・release・分岐判定などに明示的に使わない。呼出し時にx3が残っていてもcalleeの利用を証明しない。",
      "runtime_verified": false,
      "product_capability": false
    },
    {
      "id": "H014-07",
      "program": "Logic.arm64",
      "definition": "0x018e18e4",
      "anchors": [
        "018e18f8",
        "018e18fc",
        "018e1900"
      ],
      "fact": "The returned object is retained by objc_retainAutoreleasedReturnValue, saved as x19, then receives longValue directly; there is no caller-side nil/type/error branch in this sequence.",
      "fact_ja": "返されたobjectをobjc_retainAutoreleasedReturnValueでretainしx19へ保存、そのobjectへ直接longValueを送る。この並びにcaller側のnil・型・error分岐はない。",
      "runtime_verified": false,
      "product_capability": false
    },
